  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/340/winter-stress-tester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">今天就用這張壓力測試地圖來測試你的 FPS 吧。這張地圖包含一個在村落中沿著鐵軌持續移動的礦車，且天氣設定為雷暴。請依照下方的說明進行正確設定。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>操作說明</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 將你的 FOV 設定為 Quake Pro&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 將所有影片設定調整至可能的最高數值。關閉 VSync，並將最高幀率設為無限制。更多資訊請參見下方圖片。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 使用 ALT+F3 查看你的 FPS 和延遲尖峰。請記錄下你的最高、最低與平均 FPS。&nbsp;並與其他模組（Sodium、OptiFine、Canvas）或客戶端（Lunar、Badlion 等）的結果進行比較。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>我的測試結果：-<br>（無模組，Fabric Loader）<br></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最高 FPS - 31</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最低 FPS - 19</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>平均 FPS - 25</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/343/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/344/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/345/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1578\" height=\"888\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/346/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就申請一台伺服器，與朋友們一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
